-9.  Store the 4 smoothed vertices in the mesh data [S1, unofficial].
-10. Add triangle indices to the mesh. Use `voxelTriangles` if the current voxel (`localPos`) is solid, otherwise use `voxelTrianglesReverse` to maintain consistent winding order [S1, unofficial].
